OL,3,GNEWSAChild obesity rates rise among
OL,4,Ayoungest pupils
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe annual programme, which has
OL,7,Frecorded the heights and weights of
OL,8,FYear 1 and Year 5 pupils since 2013,
OL,9,Ffound 78% of children in Year 1 were at
OL,10,Fa healthy weight. That fell to 68.8%
OL,11,Famong Year 5 pupils.
